    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 120928,
        "name": {
          "full": "Sakie Satou",
          "native": "佐藤早紀絵",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120928-qtz2NcVou1o6.jpg"
        },
        "description": "A succubus who works as a math teacher. Due to the aphrodisiac her body produces, she constantly has to take precautions to avoid inadvertently seducing her male students, such as wearing a tracksuit and taking early trains. While her nature as a succubus leads several males to become attracted to her, she herself develops a crush on Tetsuo.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia)",
